# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:82
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_be18a6ea:

    # neon "Я никогда тебе этого не говорила, но..."
    neon "I've never told you this, but..."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:82
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_3528ffa0:

    # neon "Знаешь... ты мне очень напоминаешь ту девушку... из одного виде—{nw}"
    neon "You know... you really remind me of that girl... from a vide—{nw}"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:91
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_54e4be83:

    # narrator "Мелодичный звонок лифта разрезал тишину, грубо оборвав меня на полуслове."
    narrator "The melodious chime of the elevator cut through the silence, rudely interrupting me mid-sentence."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:91
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_93b1932a:

    # narrator "Я инстинктивно перевела взгляд на разъезжающиеся металлические двери."
    narrator "I instinctively shifted my gaze to the parting metal doors."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:91
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_c6728572:

    # narrator "И слова застряли у меня в горле. Сердце, секунду назад бившееся от радости, рухнуло куда-то в желудок. Кровь мгновенно заледенела."
    narrator "And the words stuck in my throat. My heart, which had been beating with joy a second ago, plummeted into my stomach. My blood instantly turned to ice."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:99
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_a2725d3a:

    # narrator "Алекс, стоявшая ко мне вполоборота, еще ничего не заметила."
    narrator "Alex, standing half-turned towards me, hadn't noticed anything yet."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:99
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_17c8c870:

    # narrator "Она искренне не понимала, почему я впала в ступор. Она мило склонила голову набок, её глаза всё ещё светились недавним смехом."
    narrator "She genuinely didn't understand why I had fallen into a stupor. She tilted her head cutely to the side, her eyes still sparkling with recent laughter."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:108
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_aa4370b5:

    # alex "М? Какую девушку, Неон? Что с тобой?"
    alex "Hmm? What girl, Neon? What's wrong?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:110
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_bdea50b3:

    # narrator "Я не могла ответить. Я просто в ужасе смотрела в кабину лифта."
    narrator "I couldn't answer. I just stared in horror into the elevator car."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:110
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_343f8373:

    # narrator "Алекс, проследив за моим остекленевшим взглядом, улыбаясь, медленно повернулась к дверям."
    narrator "Alex, following my glazed over gaze, smiled and slowly turned to the doors."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:110
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_36b0db62:

    # narrator "И её улыбка тут же испарилась."
    narrator "And her smile instantly evaporated."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:122
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_ff23e5b4:

    # narrator "Кабина была не пуста."
    narrator "The car was not empty."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:122
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_662b239c:

    # narrator "Оттуда выходил человек, поправляя идеально завязанный галстук дорогого костюма."
    narrator "A man stepped out, adjusting a perfectly tied tie on an expensive suit."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:122
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_80aa500d:

    # narrator "Увидев нас, он на долю секунды замер. Но тут же нацепил на лицо выражение ленивого, снисходительного превосходства."
    narrator "Seeing us, he froze for a fraction of a second. But immediately slapped an expression of lazy, condescending superiority onto his face."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:122
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_b3359912:

    # narrator "Это был Маркус."
    narrator "It was Marcus."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:134
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_766efb35:

    # marcus "Неон. Александра. Какая... трогательная процессия. Решили прогуляться перед увольнением?"
    marcus "Neon. Alexandra. What a... touching procession. Decided to take a walk before you're fired?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:136
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_99b54fef:

    # narrator "Неон не ответила. Она просто посмотрела на него. Холодным, тяжелым взглядом."
    narrator "Neon didn't answer. She just looked at him. With a cold, heavy gaze."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:136
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_64d827cb:

    # narrator "В ее глазах не было ни сарказма, ни злости. Только ледяная решимость."
    narrator "There was neither sarcasm nor anger in her eyes. Only icy determination."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:142
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_a7c8ba23:

    # neon "Отойди с дороги, Маркус."
    neon "Get out of the way, Marcus."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:144
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_5a6154c6:

    # narrator "Она сделала шаг вперед, намереваясь пройти мимо. Алекс последовала за ней"
    narrator "She took a step forward, intending to walk past. Alex followed her."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:144
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_93e223cc:

    # narrator "Но Маркус сделал шаг в сторону, перекрывая ей путь своим телом. Он был выше, массивнее. Он нависал над ней."
    narrator "But Marcus took a step to the side, blocking her path with his body. He was taller, more massive. He towered over her."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:150
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_5f75eb74:

    # marcus suit_smug "Тише, тише. Куда спешим? К папочке директору?"
    marcus suit_smug "Easy, easy. Where are we rushing? To daddy director?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:152
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_1e46eea8:

    # neon irritated "Узнаешь. У тебя же были дела? Ну так вот, иди."
    neon irritated "You'll find out. Don't you have things to do? Well then, off you go."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:154
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_295cf9a9:

    # narrator "Он протянул руку и схватил Неон за плечо. Не больно, но унизительно крепко. Как хозяин, удерживающий непослушного питомца."
    narrator "He reached out and grabbed Neon's shoulder. Not painfully, but humiliatingly tight. Like an owner restraining a disobedient pet."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:154
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_8fa86c92:

    # narrator "Его пальцы сжались на ткани ее халата."
    narrator "His fingers tightened on the fabric of her lab coat."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:160
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_2588a9c6:

    # marcus "Ты думаешь, тебе там кто-то рад? После того цирка, что ты устроила?"
    marcus "You think anyone is glad to see you there? After the circus you pulled?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:162
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_26c717f6:

    # narrator "Неон застыла от этого прикосновения. Но Алекс среагировала мгновенно."
    narrator "Neon froze at the touch. But Alex reacted instantly."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:171
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_beebd42f:

    # narrator "Алекс рывком вклинилась между ними. Она с силой ударила по руке Маркуса, сбивая его ладонь с плеча Неон, и толкнула его в грудь."
    narrator "Alex violently wedged herself between them. She struck Marcus's arm forcefully, knocking his hand off Neon's shoulder, and shoved him in the chest."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:171
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_71e09431:

    # narrator "В ее глазах не было страха. Только чистая, звериная защита."
    narrator "There was no fear in her eyes. Only pure, animalistic defense."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:177
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_a7b1c62b:

    # alex "{=yell}Слышь, ты! Руки убрал от моей Неон!{/yell}" with vpunch
    alex "{=yell}Hey! Get your hands off my Neon!{/yell}" with vpunch

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:181
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_cdde3629:

    # alex determined "Еще раз тронешь ее — я тебе пальцы переломаю, понял?"
    alex determined "Touch her again and I'll break your fingers, understand?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:185
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_02519f73:

    # narrator "Маркус отшатнулся от неожиданности. Он посмотрел на свою руку, потом на Алекс. В его взгляде появилось брезгливое удивление, будто на него лаяла дворняжка."
    narrator "Marcus staggered back in surprise. He looked at his hand, then at Alex. A look of disgusted surprise crossed his face, as if a mutt had barked at him."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:185
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_1b7736fe:

