    # narrator "Он наклонился к моему уху, и его голос стал вкрадчивым, липким, как нефть. Он говорил так, будто знал какой-то грязный секрет моей семьи."
    narrator "He leaned in to my ear, and his voice became insinuating, sticky like oil. He spoke as if he knew some dirty family secret of mine."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:235
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_fdda1908:

    # marcus "Ты реально думаешь, что она тебя любит? Она же даже не твоя мама."
    marcus "Do you really think she loves you? She's not even your mom."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:235
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_a72a0005:

    # marcus "Она просто... заботится о тебе, потому что ты ей нужна."
    marcus "She just... takes care of you, because she needs you."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:235
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_9227a654:

    # marcus "Ты же бесполезная, Неон. Ты никому не нужна."
    marcus "You're useless, Neon. Nobody needs you."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:245
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_090da83a:

    # neon "{=whisper}Алекс... отойди."
    neon "{=whisper}Alex... step away."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:247
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_83f87c27:

    # alex pleading "Неон? Не слушай его, он просто..."
    alex pleading "Neon? Don't listen to him, he's just..."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:249
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_fabf7d1d:

    # neon "Я сказала... отойди."
    neon "I said... step away."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:251
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_7c8d8744:

    # narrator "Голос Неон был тихим, но в нем звучала такая мертвая, холодная пустота, что Алекс инстинктивно отступила."
    narrator "Neon's voice was quiet, but it held such a dead, cold emptiness in it that Alex instinctively stepped back."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:251
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_7b7d0f06:

    # narrator "Маркус ухмыльнулся, думая, что победил."
    narrator "Marcus smirked, thinking he had won."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:257
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_d45cc90c:

    # marcus suit_smug "Кстати. Чуть не забыл. Ты, кажется, что-то потеряла утром?"
    marcus suit_smug "By the way. Almost forgot. Think you lost something this morning?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:261
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_06a009fe:

    # narrator "Он сунул руку в карман брюк и достал маленькие белые наушники. Её наушники."
    narrator "He reached into his pants pocket and pulled out small white earphones. Her earphones."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:263
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_1109659d:

    # neon surprised "Они..."
    neon surprised "They..."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:264
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_db2a8e79:

    # neon irritated "Отдай. Отдай немедленно."
    neon irritated "Give them back. Give them back right now."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:266
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_404e9757:

    # marcus "Забавная вещица. Я послушал, пока ты спала. Какая-то заунывная классика. И это помогает тебе работать? Серьезно?"
    marcus "Amusing little thing. I listened to them while you slept. Some dreary classical music. Does this really help you work? Seriously?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:268
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_2481ab08:

    # neon frustration "Не трогай их! Это... это единственное, что спасает меня от шума на работе!"
    neon frustration "Don't touch them! It's... it's the only thing that saves me from the noise at work!"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:270
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_3712cf59:

    # narrator "Неон дернулась к нему, пытаясь выхватить их, но Маркус легко поднял руку выше, как взрослый дразнит ребенка."
    narrator "Neon lunged at him, trying to snatch them, but Marcus easily lifted his arm higher, like an adult teasing a child."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:272
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_096dd07e:

    # marcus suit_sinister "Спасает от шума? Лечит душу?"
    marcus suit_sinister "Saves you from the noise? Heals your soul?"

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:274
translate english_us chapter1_confrontation_path_4e4a8efa:

    # marcus "Знаешь, Неон... Я уже нашел твой сигнал. Я сделал твою работу за тебя... А значит..."
    marcus "You know, Neon... I already found your signal. I did your job for you... And that means..."

# game/game-scripts/chapters/chapter1/7-confrontation.rpy:276
